--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Intended use
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software reads a local Apple iPhone backup that belongs to the person
running it. Backups contain messages exchanged with other people. Under the
GDPR, purely private use falls under the household exemption (Art. 2(2)(c));
publishing or passing on extracted data does not.

Running this software against another person's backup without authorisation may
be a criminal offence, for example under section 202a of the German Criminal
Code (Ausspaehen von Daten). Do not do that.

